  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nThis recipe was created by adding light pink hue and just the right amount of purple. It is well suited to portraiture as the pink hue to the skin and light creates a beautiful, yet somewhat nostalgic, ambiance. It is ideal for shooting under natural light, such as in the early morning or during the day when the light is strong. Images of scenes with little light tend to be dark, so applying brighter exposure settings may achieve the best results in these situations.",
